  - title: 02 / Compare command and position
    explanation: Jog right to verify that feedback rises. AUTO A commands 1.25 V
      or 25% travel. AUTO B commands 3.75 V or 75% travel. A command above feedback
      drives right. A command below feedback drives left. Within 0.15 V the driver
      stops.
    caption: "LEFT  \u2022  STOP  \u2022  RIGHT"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.13, y: 0.8}
      label: 5 V / RET
      color: {r: 0.28, g: 0.69, b: 1, a: 1}
    - id: driver
