  - title: 03 / Diagnose the reversed motor
    explanation: Remove W05 and W06. Connect OUT A to MOTOR B and OUT B to MOTOR
      A, then press TEST FAULT. The carriage moves away and stops. Restore both leads
      and select AUTO B.
    caption: "WRONG DIRECTION  \u2022  SAFE STOP"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.13, y: 0.8}
