  - title: 04 / Reject a disturbance
    explanation: Nudge left. The controller drives right until the carriage settles.
      Then nudge right. The controller drives left until it settles again. The feedback
      loop holds the same position command.
    caption: "AUTO B  \u2022  CORRECT FROM BOTH SIDES"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.13, y: 0.8}
      label: 5 V / RET
